              "string": ""
            },
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [15], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10120, "indent": 0, "parameters": [0, 0, 0, 0], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "MEMNOSYNE"},
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "Are you feeling better?"},
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [20], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "TALAN"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Yeah... yeah, I'm all right. Just a little"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "dazed, I guess. Kind of dizzy..."
            },
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "EMILY"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "What's going on? What did you do"
            },
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "to Talan?!"},
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [15], "string": ""},
            {"code": 11510, "indent": 0, "parameters": [0, 100, 100, 50], "string": "elf2"},
            {"code": 11330, "indent": 0, "parameters": [2, 8, 0, 0, 15], "string": ""},
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [30], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "MEMNOSYNE"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Many, many years ago, I came across"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "a band of survivors from the ruins of the"
            },
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "Kingdom of Surl."},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "MEMNOSYNE"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "They were half-starved and close to"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "death. They had struggled to survive"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "in the wilderness during the years"
            },
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "MEMNOSYNE"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "following the destruction of Surl, but"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "had descended almost to the level of"
            },
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "beasts."},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "MEMNOSYNE"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "They were terribly sick, from all sorts of"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "diseases, and many had severe cases"
            },
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "of radiation poisoning."},
            {"code": 11330, "indent": 0, "parameters": [2, 8, 0, 0, 13], "string": ""},
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [10], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "MEMNOSYNE"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "But there was one man who had"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "retained his sanity. He called himself"
            },
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "the Keeper of Memories."},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "MEMNOSYNE"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Somehow, the Keeper had the power"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "to take the memories of others for his"
            },
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "own."},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "MEMNOSYNE"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "He had wandered all throughout the"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "ruins of Surl, finding the survivors and"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "absorbing their memories."
            },
            {"code": 11330, "indent": 0, "parameters": [2, 8, 0, 0, 3, 3], "string": ""},
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [20], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "MEMNOSYNE"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Within his mind, the Keeper stored"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "all of the memories of Surl, so that when"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "the final survivor died, the memory of"
            },
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "MEMNOSYNE"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "the kingdom would live on within"
            },
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "the Keeper's mind."},
            {"code": 11330, "indent": 0, "parameters": [2, 8, 0, 0, 2, 2], "string": ""},
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [15], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "MEMNOSYNE"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "But the Keeper was dying. He had"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "been present at the time Surl was"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "destroyed, and although his sickness"
            },
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "MEMNOSYNE"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "was slower than it was for most,"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "he did not have long to live, and"
            },
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "Surl would die with him."},
            {"code": 11330, "indent": 0, "parameters": [2, 8, 0, 0, 13], "string": ""},
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [20], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "MEMNOSYNE"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "He chose... no... I volunteered..."
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "to receive the memories he had absorbed."
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "The memories of an entire kingdom."
            },
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "MEMNOSYNE"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "He placed his fingertips on my forehead,"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "and I collapsed. I awoke sometime later,"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "with the Keeper dead beside me."
            },
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "MEMNOSYNE"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "I had become the new Keeper of"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Memories, and by doing so, all memory"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "of who I was before... vanished."
            },
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "MEMNOSYNE"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "I lost my own history, but gained that"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "of a doomed nation. The survivors brought"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "me, still swooning, back to this place."
            },
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [10], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "EMILY"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "But what does this have to do with -"
            },
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "MEMNOSYNE"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "It's so lonely here - I wanted to see the"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "things you've all seen, experience your"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "experiences. I wanted to feel Hope."
            },
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "MEMNOSYNE"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Hope is something no one in Surl"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "possessed: only despair, fear, sadness,"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "and hatred. It is a heavy burden I bear."
            },
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "MEMNOSYNE"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "I opened a Memory Pathway to Talan's"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "mind, but he followed it BACK, to me..."
            },
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "MEMNOSYNE"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "And in the split second before I was"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "able to shut down the Pathway, he"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "glimpsed the entirety of my memory..."
            },
            {"code": 11330, "indent": 0, "parameters": [2, 8, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1], "string": ""},
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [20], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "MEMNOSYNE"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "You're lucky, Talan - if the Pathway"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "had remained open for any longer, your"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "body might not have recovered as quickly."
            },
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [20], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "TALAN"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "It was... overwhelming - so many voices!"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Each one had its story to tell, and each"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "story was one of despair... it was horrible."
            },
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "TALAN"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "I can't remember any specifics, though."
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Just terrible, terrible pain and anger."
            },
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "TALAN"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "I don't know how you can live with it."
            },
            {"code": 11330, "indent": 0, "parameters": [2, 8, 0, 0, 12], "string": ""},
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [10], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "MEMNOSYNE"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Oh, I think you do, dearie. We all have"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "our own ways of dealing with our dark"
            },
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "little secrets."},
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [5], "string": ""},
            {"code": 11330, "indent": 0, "parameters": [10001, 8, 0, 0, 13], "string": ""},
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [10], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "TALAN"},
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "... ... ..."},
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [15], "string": ""},
            {"code": 11330, "indent": 0, "parameters": [3, 8, 0, 0, 12], "string": ""},
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [10], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "EMILY"},
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "But what do we do now?"},
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "Where should we go?"},
            {"code": 11330, "indent": 0, "parameters": [2, 8, 0, 0, 13], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "MEMNOSYNE"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "I know where you should not go:"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "the ruins of Surl are not for the"
            },
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "faint-hearted."},
            {"code": 11330, "indent": 0, "parameters": [3, 8, 0, 0, 15], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "EMILY"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "We can't just go back north! The Agency"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "is probably still at... well, still on our trail..."
            },
            {"code": 11330, "indent": 0, "parameters": [10001, 8, 0, 0, 15], "string": ""},
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [10], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "TALAN"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "I think we should go west. The Agency"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "probably expects us to try and escape"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "through Surl to the south, and if we"
            },
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "TALAN"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "go east, we're heading straight for"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Prima City and the heart of the"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Agency's power structure."
            },
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "MEMNOSYNE"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "There is a set of tunnels nearby that"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "may get you beyond the western"
            },
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "mountains."},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "MEMNOSYNE"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "I'll show you the way first thing in"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "the morning. And Talan... I'm sorry"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "for intruding on your own memories."
            },
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "MEMNOSYNE"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "It was good to share my story with"
            },
